==Battleground==
*3 [[Metal Snache]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*5 [[Metal Snache]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Mecha-Bun (Enemy)|Mecha-Bun]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Super Metal Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 36.67~40 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,200f</sup>.
**3 [[THE METAL SLOTH]]s spawn, delay 46.67~50 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,500f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Metal Doge]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
:''This floor is identical to the corresponding Heavenly Tower floor. As such, see [[Heavenly Tower/Floor 48#Strategy|Floor 48]] for strategies.''

